<title>USA: U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS -- Issues to watch.</title>
<headline>U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS -- Issues to watch.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stocks to watch this morning:</p>
<p>* Nordstrom Inc fell one point to 35 in after-hours trading Thursday following release of its 1996 fourth quarter results in the late afternoon.</p>
<p>* The United Auto Wokers union said a tentative pact reached this week with Johnson Controls Inc calls for wage increases of 22 percent  over three years. Johnson Controls closed at 86 Thursday.  </p>
<p>* Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn and International Business Machines Corp's IBM Global Services have signed a $55 million deal under which IBM would take care of Pharmacia's information systems. Pharmacia closed at 36-7/8 while IBM finished at 140-7/8.</p>
</text>
